
1. System Objectives- We are developing this project to solve 
the problem of our identified stakeholders, specifically;
    >Customers- customer rely on scattered platform to look
    for reliable and trustworthy flowershops. To solve this problem 
    we are making this project to help them find their preferred
    flowers.
    > Owners- flower shop owners are facing difficulty on how customers will
    find or discover their flower shops. they also want to have a platform
    that will showcase their products. That is why this system has a purpose
    to showcase their product and also monitor their sales and connect
    with the customers.
    >Florist- not all florist has flower shops, and florists also want to showcase 
    the product they have even they don't have physical store, with this
    platform they will be able to do it.

2. Proposed Scope- The scope of this project is for ordering,tracking of order, managing the sales
for the sellers, creating reports, and managing users for the admin, however this 
project will not integarate payment gateway.
3. Stakeholers- The identified stakeholders are the customer, flower shop oweners and florists.
4. Tools- we are expecting to use framework(react), database (firebase)